  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Istanbul Metropolitan Municipality Cybersecurity Pilot Project Feasibility Study, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is funding a pilot project to support the Istanbul Metropolitan Municipality (IMM) in enhancing its existing cybersecurity platform and providing cybersecurity-as-a-service to the 30 IMM municipal companies. The pilot project would include an assessment of IMMs IT infrastructure, pilot implementations of cybersecurity technologies, and training for key personnel in IMMs IT department.</narrative>
  </description>
